<Layout title="About | Karl Arabit">
	<h2>About</h2>
	<h3>I do cybersecurity, I guess.</h3>
	<p>I spend a lot of time working on <a href="https://cyberacad.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">CyberAcad</a>, a non-profit I co-founded to teach cybersecurity to youth and people my age.
		As I'm writing this, we have maybe 800+ users, but I'm looking to get that number way higher!</p>

	<p>Another one of my big projects is <a href="https://boroctf.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">boroCTF</a>. Me and my friends decided we wanted to make a CTF, so we did! We had over 2,000 amazing competitors from over 93 countries, and I couldn't be happier with the turn out. Stay tuned for next year!</p>

	<h3>What else?</h3>
	<p>Outside of cybersecurity, I do a lot in music! I play the guitar, bass, piano, and drums, and I'm in two bands regularly performing.</p>
